  "chapter": "STEAM_AGE",
  "description": '§aSnad§r instantly grows sugarcane or cacti with a redstone update.

For max yield, attach a redstone conduit to Snad (force output with Yeta Wrench/Crescent Hammer), then add a "Redstone Sensor Filter" to the conduit\'s input. This gives near-instant sugarcane growth.


---



Use a piston/observer to break cane early (collect with vacuum chest), then upgrade to the superior Actually Additions Auto-Breaker (requires Void Crystal from Lost Cities/Nether or early MV crafting).

§cIMPORTANT!§r Void sugarcane overflow! Use a Storage Void Upgrade in a drawer to prevent lag/corruption. Seriously, void it!',
